Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.85,0:00:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.45,0:00:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.17,0:00:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.61,0:01:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.93,0:01:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Winged Dragon of Ra, destroy\Nhis monster and grave his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.45,0:01:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nothing that can prepare you for\Nthe devastation you're about to endure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.51,0:01:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.25,0:01:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escaping the fury of\Nthe most supreme Egyptian god!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.79,0:01:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.19,0:01:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight it, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.41,0:01:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you feel every ounce of\Nenergy leaving your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.51,0:01:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.41,0:01:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.49,0:01:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Merrick's shadow game, Ra's\Nattack is draining Joey's inner strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.75,0:01:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.37,0:01:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's gone over the line this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.43,0:02:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta stop this duel now\Nbefore things get any worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.89,0:02:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can stop this duel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I must witness Ra's special\Nability with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.57,0:02:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Gilbert is gone, and you're\Nabout to follow little Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.31,0:02:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So return to me, my great beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.67,0:02:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your task is now complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.19,0:02:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,When the smoke clears,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.27,0:02:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be nothing but a motionless\Nshell. And without your inner strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.91,0:02:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,the Shadow Realm will easily consume\Nyour mind and your soul At least
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.19,0:02:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend Mai won't be alone. You'll\Nbe wandering the shadows together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be No one can withstand the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.39,0:02:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Devastating fury of an Egyptian\Ngod monster! Ah! No one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.71,0:02:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.75,0:02:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:02:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But for how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.25,0:03:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.16,0:03:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.11,0:03:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be wiped out by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.65,0:03:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.59,0:03:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.50,0:03:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of dreams, where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.27,0:03:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Yugi, or is Marek\Nmessing with my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting ready for our duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.95,0:03:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The last match of the Battle City Finals!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.83,0:03:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Hugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.51,0:03:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't I in the middle\Nof a duel with Marek?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.25,0:03:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Last thing I remember, he attacked\Nme with his Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where is that freak Marek anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.11,0:03:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And the rest of the gang?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.41,0:03:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.79,0:03:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mind's in a state of shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.11,0:03:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.37,0:03:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your willpower was strong enough\Nto resist the force of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.01,0:03:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, now Marek's wide\Nopen for my attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly, now get back there and finish\Nhim off, so you can save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:04:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to put an end to\NMarek's evil for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.15,0:04:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If he succeeds in\Nattacking my life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lose the duel and\Nmy inhibition god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.17,0:04:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.95,0:04:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my turn now, and you're wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.45,0:04:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.81,0:04:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey beat Merrick at his own game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.01,0:04:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All he needs is a monster\Nwith enough attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.59,0:04:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and then Joey will make it to the\Nfinal round of the tournament, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.89,0:04:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.65,0:04:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he withstand Ra?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.19,0:04:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move, Joey,\Nand end this madness now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.07,0:04:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.91,0:04:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gierfried,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.82,0:04:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the Iron Knight He's got more than enough
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.13,0:04:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Power to wipe Marrick out.\NWhat card did he draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.11,0:04:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Marrick. I summon\NGierfried, the Iron Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.95,0:05:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this can't be possible Hurry\Nup and call your attack, Joey
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.01,0:05:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.01,0:05:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.59,0:05:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.05,0:05:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.91,0:05:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone get a doctor! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.31,0:05:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's still on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.39,0:05:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler has 30 seconds to get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.09,0:05:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.45,0:05:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget your rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.21,0:05:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey needs help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.79,0:05:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.70,0:05:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can help him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.33,0:05:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey has five seconds to rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.37,0:05:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The duel is now over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.75,0:05:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.73,0:05:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see Joey's in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:05:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.43,0:06:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.99,0:06:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,In accordance with tournament\Nrules, Joey is disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.91,0:06:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So the winner of this\Nduel is Marek Ishtar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.07,0:06:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.07,0:06:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.63,0:06:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.53,0:06:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get him downstairs right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.07,0:06:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs to see a doctor now. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.21,0:06:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought Wheeler could withstand an
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.77,0:06:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,attack by the most powerful\NEgyptian god guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.43,0:06:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There goes another soul\Ninto the dark abyss of the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.97,0:06:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow Realm to wander the\Nemptiness for eternity. Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.83,0:06:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to open up your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.25,0:06:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, it's me, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.57,0:06:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me you can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You better stop kidding\Naround and get up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.71,0:06:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight it, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.31,0:06:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too strong to let Merrick\Nget the best of you, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.03,0:07:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose him to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.69,0:07:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I must admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler's performance\Ntoday was quite impressive
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.35,0:07:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps he's not the third-rate\Namateur I thought he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that your friend is out of the way\NI'm one duel away from world domination,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.11,0:07:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.15,0:07:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,When will all this madness come to an end?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.77,0:07:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,When the infinite power of\Nthe Pharaoh belongs to me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.59,0:07:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.75,0:07:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be dueling against me in the last\Nround, and I intend to win. Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.93,0:07:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, first I'll face off against Yugi And\Nonce I strip him of Slifer the Sky Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be ready to crush you and claim\Nyour winged dragon of Ra You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.31,0:07:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I've studied it quite carefully
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.65,0:07:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have just the card to destroy it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.01,0:07:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:08:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,you have it all figured out But perhaps\Nyou should focus on getting past the next
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.43,0:08:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,round Get him on that stretcher and take\Nhim down to the medical room immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.45,0:08:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.75,0:08:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll never awaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.77,0:08:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.25,0:08:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.83,0:08:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The next duel will begin in one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.29,0:08:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Moto will face Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.83,0:08:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner will duel\NMaric in the final round.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.77,0:08:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this moment, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.55,0:08:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.41,0:08:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, Joey needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.77,0:08:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I know he's all right,\NI'll deal with you, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.19,0:08:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you in one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.77,0:08:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll take you down once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.85,0:08:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal, Doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.93,0:08:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,His brain is functioning normally\Nand his heart rate is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:09:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.57,0:09:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't moved or spoken in 20 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.39,0:09:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, please, you've\Ngot to open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.87,0:09:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this isn't Kaiba's duel tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.87,0:09:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How in the world did I get out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.89,0:09:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.81,0:09:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.72,0:09:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.63,0:09:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Moto?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.55,0:09:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have you been hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.59,0:09:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be asking you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.61,0:09:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been looking all over for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.09,0:09:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now move your tail feathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.07,0:09:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So where are we going, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.89,0:09:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.87,0:09:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A huge duel monsters\Ntournament starts today and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.11,0:09:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,you're late for your first\Nduel but aren't we already in
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.45,0:09:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,a tournament yeah but this\Nis a dream so it's not
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.85,0:09:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,supposed to make sense that's\Na good point yuki but dream
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,or no dream if you miss\Nthis duel young man you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.89,0:09:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,be disqualified from the\Ntournament hold on maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.43,0:09:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,that's not such a bad thing\Ni need some rest come on
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.87,0:09:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,joey this is the most important\Ntournament of your life
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.77,0:10:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so strange. Joey's brain activity is\Nquite high, however he's not conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,At all. To be honest, I've never seen\Nanything like this before. Joey's will
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.99,0:10:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,is very strong his mind must be\Nfighting off the shadows it's all right
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.23,0:10:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, I just want my brother back. I\Nunderstand, both of our brothers must now
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.69,0:10:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,battle the darkness mokuba when are
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.37,0:10:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,we moving joey to a real hospital i've
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.93,0:10:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,got bad news i don't think we're gonna\Nmove joey anywhere right now guys those
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.41,0:10:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,orders came from seto you've got to be\Nkidding he says our own doctors are good
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.19,0:10:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,enough i don't believe this besides our\Nengines are damaged and we can't move
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.07,0:10:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,it happened when we barely escaped that\Nexplosion on the way to kaiba core violence
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.73,0:10:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship made it here, but\Nnow our engines are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.89,0:11:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not supposed to tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.91,0:11:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're stuck here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.49,0:11:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.17,0:11:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll radio headquarters and make sure they\Nsend over a helicopter right away, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.05,0:11:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.79,0:11:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just promise you won't tell Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.85,0:11:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lips are sealed, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.13,0:11:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, hang in there, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.49,0:11:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault this happened to Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.69,0:11:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have faced Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.83,0:11:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.95,0:11:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that duel was too dangerous,\Nand I should have stopped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.81,0:11:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick is pure evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.63,0:11:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,First he got Mai, then Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.31,0:11:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.22,0:11:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should stop fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.43,0:11:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It just seems to make things worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.03,0:11:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.15,0:11:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.23,0:11:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.91,0:12:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Together, we won't let\Nany duelist beat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.33,0:12:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.65,0:12:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll hit this manic creep and his\Nrare hunter goon squad so hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.35,0:12:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,they won't know what hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.91,0:12:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be sorry they ever\Ndecided to mess with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.07,0:12:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.49,0:12:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of us shall\Nsave the world together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.25,0:12:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, count on me, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.41,0:12:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never give up this fight\Nagainst Marek, no matter what, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.59,0:12:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this is hard for you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.31,0:12:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek is the toughest\Nfoe we've ever faced.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.21,0:12:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we walk away now, then he wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.71,0:12:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.62,0:12:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey never gave up, and neither can we.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.27,0:12:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to finish what we\Nstarted, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.75,0:12:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's madness has to\Nstop now. He's caused way too
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.37,0:12:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,much damage already And I'm\Nnot gonna lose another friend
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.61,0:12:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give up if you don't,\NJoey Keep fighting the shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.87,0:13:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Flameswordsman, attack his hologram.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.05,0:13:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm still a foster, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.01,0:13:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the duelinator?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.93,0:13:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.65,0:13:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.95,0:13:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm winning duels left\Nand right in this dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.83,0:13:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not going to stop\Nuntil I get to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.07,0:13:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's path of destruction\Nis so unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.07,0:13:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.35,0:13:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so unclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.49,0:13:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.29,0:13:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just check your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.93,0:13:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, was that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.89,0:13:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.43,0:13:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have just been wishful thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.31,0:14:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.05,0:14:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Necklace. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.61,0:14:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.19,0:14:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizu said she didn't need it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate has now chosen you to possess this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.91,0:14:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This necklace has the power to\Nshow me events before they happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.91,0:14:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But the last time a Shizu used it\Nto predict the future, it was wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.95,0:14:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So can I trust what it shows me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.61,0:14:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If I concentrate, the Millennium\NNecklace should show me the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.31,0:14:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.59,0:14:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.25,0:14:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yuge, now that that's all over\Nwith, let's duel, pal. You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.63,0:14:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Could that have been a\Nvision of the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.07,0:14:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the Millennium Necklace is\Ntelling me Joey's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But who knows if it's right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.51,0:14:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.95,0:15:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please report to the top floor of the\Ntower for the next duel of the semifinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.43,0:15:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuge Moto will face off against Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.17,0:15:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner will continue\Non to the final round.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.05,0:15:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to believe what\Nthe necklace predicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.97,0:15:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon all of this insanity will be\Nover and Joey will be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.81,0:15:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to get past Kaiba so\NI can defeat Merrick and end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.89,0:15:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.27,0:15:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.47,0:15:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a helicopter right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.45,0:15:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.51,0:15:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.69,0:15:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We seem to be experiencing\Ntemporary transmission
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,interference due to our\Ndistance from the mainland,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.03,0:15:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,sir. Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.77,0:15:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in, anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.15,0:15:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Send a rescue copter immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.77,0:15:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.49,0:15:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.65,0:15:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pretty much the same, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.79,0:15:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But knowing Joey, he's doing\Nwhatever it takes to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.23,0:16:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he'll need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.85,0:16:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,His duel disc?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.59,0:16:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd want it close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.73,0:16:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point. For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.87,0:16:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,His toughest fight yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Look after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.81,0:16:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall return from this\Nduel as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.01,0:16:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.92,0:16:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.49,0:16:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're actually gonna go\Nahead with this duel up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.01,0:16:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget how many people have\Ngotten hurt in the tournament so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.83,0:16:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Yugi, enough's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.93,0:16:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand the thought\Nof losing you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.65,0:16:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.11,0:16:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not worth all this suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.17,0:16:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This tournament's been\Nnothing but bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.59,0:16:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.45,0:16:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I walk away now, that means\Neveryone suffered for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.93,0:16:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've got to have faith in the\Nvisions of the Millennium Necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.73,0:16:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's going to\Nbe back to normal soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.77,0:17:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to win this tournament\Nfirst, and I'll start by defeating Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.41,0:17:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya, remember what we learned\Non our trip to the Domino Museum?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.29,0:17:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,About my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.83,0:17:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.45,0:17:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We found out that you were\Na pharaoh in ancient Egypt,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.53,0:17:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and that now you need\Nto save the world again
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,from some evil thingy like\Nyou did 5,000 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, if what Ashizu told us about\Nthese stone carvings is really true... Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.23,0:17:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I need to win a\Ndual monsters tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.89,0:17:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to save the\Nworld from destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.25,0:17:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.29,0:17:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.43,0:17:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you now understand why backing out\Nof the tournament is not an option?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.47,0:17:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.38,0:17:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No buts, Teya!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.29,0:17:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason I joined the Battle\NCity Tournament was to fulfill
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.47,0:17:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ashizu's prophecy and stop this\Ngreat evil from endangering mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.83,0:18:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And when Joey found out, he vowed to\Nhelp me, no matter how tough the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.39,0:18:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why I must press on. Otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.37,0:18:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,not only would I be giving up on Joey,\NI'd be giving up on the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.01,0:18:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So you stay here and I'll deal with Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.93,0:18:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, crush him! I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.57,0:18:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There's too much at stake to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.39,0:18:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We're right here. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.47,0:18:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can win this, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.35,0:18:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I don't want to think\Nabout what'll happen if you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.11,0:18:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The second duel of the semifinals\Nwill begin in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.23,0:18:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.03,0:18:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Dueling Kaiba is not going to be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.81,0:18:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never had to face his Obelisk the\NTormentor before. And I really wish
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.55,0:18:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey was able to watch But he'll\Ndefinitely be there with me in spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.73,0:18:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.64,0:18:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba You may think you're\Nthe world's greatest duelist
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.43,0:19:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But the fate of the world\Nis riding on my victory
